INTERVIEW QUESTION 1
What is Generative AI?
======================

Interview Answer:
Generative AI is a type of Artificial Intelligence that learns patterns
from large amounts of training data and generates new content such as
text, images, code, audio, and videos. Unlike traditional AI, which
mainly analyzes or classifies existing data, Generative AI creates new
content that resembles the data it was trained on.

Key Points:
✔ Learns patterns from training data
✔ Generates NEW content
✔ Can generate text, code, images, audio, and video
✔ Does not simply copy training data

Example:
• ChatGPT
• GitHub Copilot
• DALL·E
• Gemini

---

