COMMON INTERVIEW TRAPS
======================

Q. Does Generative AI copy training data?

Answer:
No. It learns patterns and relationships from training data and
generates new content. It does not simply copy the training data.

---

Q. Is GitHub Copilot Generative AI?

Answer:
GitHub Copilot is an AI-powered coding assistant built using
Generative AI models. Code generation is the application, while
Copilot is the tool.

---

Q. Can Traditional AI generate new content?

Answer:
No. Traditional AI mainly predicts, classifies, detects, or recommends.
Content generation is a capability of Generative AI.

